<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Akzo Nobel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Akzo Nobel.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Salomon Brothers analyst Peter Blair said he upgraded Akzo Nobel to a strong buy from a buy. He also raised his target price to $73.50 from $66.</p>
<p>--Blair said the company's new antidepressant, Remeron, &quot;is proving to be superior to Prozac.&quot; He said the company believes the drug can reach the top three in the antidepressant market for worldwide sales, which implies that sales can reach $1 billion.</p>
<p>--&quot;We believe that the stock price doesn't fully reflect this potential,&quot; Blair said.</p>
</text>
